invalid type: string "19\nGoal: Build Your Brand on eBay and Beyond\n \u{f06f} Become an eBay Stores subscriber\n \u{f06f}  Set up your Store with custom store pages and categories, listing frames, and \npromotion boxes\n \u{f06f} Opt in to cross-merchandising\n \u{f06f} Create and send email newsletters (ongoing)\n \u{f06f} Put items on sale using Markdown Manager (ongoing)\n \u{f06f}ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ